    "name": "Unless Practice Routine",
    "text": "1\nUnless Practice Routine\nInstructions\n\nDiagram three out of these four Unless statements:\n\n~A, unless B.\n\nUnless B, A.\n\nUnless ~B, ~A.\n\nA, unless ~B.\n\nSwitch up which three statements you diagram every time.\n\nStart every LSAT study session with this quick workout until you can diagram Unless accurately in under 5 seconds.\n\nSEE FULL WORKOUT DETAILS",
